<div class="help-page">
  <h1>Help</h1>

  <h2>Browsing Resources</h2>
  <p>Use the <a href="https://data-library-browser-85fc677edd07.herokuapp.com/">Explorer</a> page to explore available resource types. Click on a resource type to see a paginated list of items.</p>

  <h2>Searching and Filtering</h2>
  <p>You can filter results using query parameters. For example:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>/explorer/research-briefings?topic=123</code> - Filter by topic</li>
    <li><code>/explorer/research-briefings?publisher=456</code> - Filter by publisher</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pagination</h2>
  <p>Results are paginated. Use the navigation links at the top and bottom of the list to move between pages.</p>

  <h2>RSS Feeds</h2>
  <p>RSS feeds are available for each resource type:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>/explorer/research-briefings/feed</code></li>
    <li><code>/explorer/deposited-papers/feed</code></li>
  </ul>
</div>
